@page "/compare"

@*
    Standalone paste-two-texts diff tool, on the design system's archetype 11
    (.pw frame + .cmp compare body - see .design/handoff/PageCompare.dc.html).
    The same frame as the Object Explorer's file diff, because it is the same
    screen with a different source for the two sides.

    The two side-by-side panes ARE the input: they're editable CodeMirror
    editors (mountCompareEditor). As you type or paste, source-viewer.js
    debounces and POSTs both texts to /api/compare/diff, which reuses the same
    DiffPlex + SideBySideDiffSerializer pipeline the Object Explorer compare
    page renders, then swaps the diff decorations into both panes in place
    (setDiff) - no remount, so typed text and undo history survive.

    Static SSR, no [Authorize] and no Blazor circuit: like the Object Explorer
    viewer, all interactivity lives in source-viewer.js. Works without an
    account; nothing is stored server-side. The page is just the shell -
    source-viewer.js owns the editors, the live re-diff, the summary read-out,
    and the Swap / Clear / change-navigation controls (wired by their
    data-* attributes below).
*@

<PageTitle>Compare · AL Dev Toolbox</PageTitle>

<div class="pw u-compact">
    <div class="pw__head">
        <div class="pw__title">
            <span class="pw__name">Compare</span>
            <span class="pw__file">Paste two versions of any text to see what changed</span>
        </div>

        <span class="pw__spacer"></span>

        @* Both start switched off: there is nothing to swap or clear on an
           empty page, and a live button that does nothing is a worse first
           impression than one that waits its turn. source-viewer.js enables
           them as soon as either side has text. *@
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--sm" data-compare-swap disabled>
            <Icon Name="arrow-left-right" Width="14" Height="14" Css="btn__icon" />
            <span>Swap sides</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--sm" data-compare-clear disabled>
            <Icon Name="trash-2" Width="14" Height="14" Css="btn__icon" />
            <span>Clear both</span>
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="pw__bar">
        <div class="vsbar">
            <span class="vs">
                <span class="vs__side">
                    <span class="vs__label">Left</span>
                    <span class="vs__name">The original</span>
                </span>
                <Icon Name="arrow-right" Css="vs__arrow" />
                <span class="vs__side">
                    <span class="vs__label">Right</span>
                    <span class="vs__name">The changed version</span>
                </span>
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pw__body">
        @* No change rail: the two panes are the whole comparison, so there is
           no list of other files to walk. *@
        <div class="cmp cmp--norail">
            <div class="cmp__view">
                <div class="cmp__vbar">
                    @* The live read-out. Sits where the file diff puts its
                       "+14 -6", because it answers the same question. *@
                    <span class="cmp__vname" data-compare-summary>
                        Paste or type into either side to see what changed.
                    </span>
                    <span class="pw__spacer"></span>
                    <span class="kbd-hint">
                        <span class="kbd" data-mod-key>Ctrl</span><span class="kbd">Down</span><span class="kbd-hint__label">next change</span>
                    </span>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn--icon btn--sm" data-diff-nav="prev" disabled
                            aria-label="Previous change" title="Jump to the previous change (Ctrl + Up arrow)">
                        <Icon Name="chevron-up" Width="14" Height="14" Css="btn__icon" />
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn--icon btn--sm" data-diff-nav="next" disabled
                            aria-label="Next change" title="Jump to the next change (Ctrl + Down arrow)">
                        <Icon Name="chevron-down" Width="14" Height="14" Css="btn__icon" />
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="cmp__panes">
                    <div class="cmp__pane cmp__pane--host" role="group" aria-label="Original text">
                        <div class="cmp__phead">
                            <span class="refchip refchip--base">Original</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="source-viewer source-viewer--compare" data-pane="left">
                            <div class="source-viewer__code"
                                 data-language="text"
                                 data-editable="true"
                                 data-content=""
                                 data-placeholder="Paste the original version here"
                                 spellcheck="false"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp__pane cmp__pane--host" role="group" aria-label="Changed text">
                        <div class="cmp__phead">
                            <span class="refchip refchip--target">Changed</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="source-viewer source-viewer--compare" data-pane="right">
                            <div class="source-viewer__code"
                                 data-language="text"
                                 data-editable="true"
                                 data-content=""
                                 data-placeholder="Paste the changed version here"
                                 spellcheck="false"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pw__foot">
        <span>Your text is sent to this server to compare it, and never stored</span>
        <span class="pw__sep"></span>
        <span class="kbd-hint">
            <span class="kbd" data-mod-key>Ctrl</span><span class="kbd">Down</span><span class="kbd-hint__label">next change</span>
        </span>
        <span class="kbd-hint">
            <span class="kbd" data-mod-key>Ctrl</span><span class="kbd">Up</span><span class="kbd-hint__label">previous</span>
        </span>
        <span class="kbd-hint">
            <span class="kbd-hint__label">Scrolling either side moves the other</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
